#. module: account_commission_payment_settlement
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_commission_payment_settlement.field_account_invoice_line_agent__pending_amount
msgid ""
"Payment based commission amount not settled yet: the commission amount while"
" the invoice is paid, or zero when it is not, minus the amount already "
"settled."
msgstr ""
"Importe de la comisión basada en el pago aún no liquidado: el importe de la "
"comisión mientras la factura está cobrada, o cero si no lo está, menos el "
"importe ya liquidado."

